    "detailed_description": "Join Us On Discord!<br><br> <br><br>Take Flight in Windhelm, a fresh take on open-world fantasy RPGs. With procedural world generation, no experience will be the same. Charge into an original adventure with Garth, a young explorer who is determined to choose his own fate as a jack-of-all-trades as he plunges into the world of Windhelm. On a quest to save his father, Garth will have to fly off his home island and face multiple challenges including dungeons, multifaceted enemies, a crooked King, and his own family\u2019s hallowed past all while trying to survive the elements of a world never explored before.",
    "about_the_game": "Join Us On Discord!<br><br> <br><br>Take Flight in Windhelm, a fresh take on open-world fantasy RPGs. With procedural world generation, no experience will be the same. Charge into an original adventure with Garth, a young explorer who is determined to choose his own fate as a jack-of-all-trades as he plunges into the world of Windhelm. On a quest to save his father, Garth will have to fly off his home island and face multiple challenges including dungeons, multifaceted enemies, a crooked King, and his own family\u2019s hallowed past all while trying to survive the elements of a world never explored before.",
    "short_description": "Soar into the unexplored world of Windhelm, an open-world fantasy RPG. Fly through the floating islands as you go on a mighty quest to defeat monsters, clear dungeons, and battle perilous enemies. Survive the harsh elements with nothing but your wits and craftable items.",
